1
00:00:04,663 --> 00:00:07,543
(Sheldon:)I just want you both to know,
when I publish my findings...

2
00:00:07,708 --> 00:00:11,418
(Sheldon:)-...I won't forget your contributions.
-Great.

3
00:00:11,587 --> 00:00:13,757
(Sheldon:)I can't mention you
in my Nobel acceptance speech.

4
00:00:13,922 --> 00:00:15,502
When I write my memoirs...

5
00:00:15,674 --> 00:00:19,724
(Sheldon:)...you can expect a very effusive footnote
and perhaps a signed copy.

6
00:00:20,971 --> 00:00:23,681
(Raj:)-We have to tell him.
-Tell me what?

7
00:00:24,808 --> 00:00:27,558
(Howard:)Damn his Vulcan hearing.

8
00:00:28,020 --> 00:00:30,310
You are planning a party for me,
aren't you?

9
00:00:31,148 --> 00:00:32,938
(Howard:)Okay, Sheldon, sit down.

10
00:00:33,734 --> 00:00:36,444
(Sheldon:)If there's going to be a theme,
I should let you know...

11
00:00:36,612 --> 00:00:38,902
(Sheldon:)...I don't care for luau, toga
or under the sea.

12
00:00:41,241 --> 00:00:44,531
(Howard:)Yeah. We'll keep that in mind.
Look, we need to talk to you...

13
00:00:44,703 --> 00:00:47,543
(Howard:)...about something that happened
at the North Pole.

14
00:00:47,706 --> 00:00:49,996
(Sheldon:)If this is about the night
the heat went out...

15
00:00:50,167 --> 00:00:52,757
(Sheldon:)...there's nothing
to be embarrassed about.

16
00:00:54,004 --> 00:00:57,464
(Raj:)-It's not about that.
-We agreed to never speak of it again.

17
00:00:57,633 --> 00:01:02,023
(Sheldon:)So we slept together naked.

